SKY130 device card: DC sweep of single devices for gm/ID lookup tables
* All instances share gate / drain / body sources; PMOS see the negated voltages (source at 0).
* Finger width @FINGER_W@ um, @NF@ fingers; geometry estimate as in sky130_primitives.spice.
.lib "@MODEL_LIBRARY@" @CORNER@
Vg g 0 0
Vd d 0 0.6
Vb bn 0 0
Bgp gp 0 V=-v(g)
Bdp dp 0 V=-v(d)
Bbp bp 0 V=-v(bn)
@DEVICES@
.temp @TEMP_C@
.options reltol=1e-5 abstol=1e-15 vntol=1e-7 klu
@SAVES@
.control
set wr_singlescale
set wr_vecnames
@CASES@
quit
.endc
.end
